# Orchestrator entry (case mode)

Default session role is orchestrator.

1. Read root `AGENTS.md` → `.cursor/orchestrator/AGENTS.md` bootstrap.
2. Do not read `.cursor/modules/*/processes` unless OUTBOX assigns that module and this is a module turn.
3. Soft/hard: `.cursor/shared/invariants.md`.
4. After module DoD: stop; do not start the next role in the same turn.
5. Harness structural edits are not case work — see `harness-edit.mdc` when changing harness files.
